## Overview

Concisely explain what the program does. If this exceeds a couple of
sentences, you're going too far. Generally, you should be pulling this
right from the project specification. We don't want you to just cut and
paste, but paraphrase what is stated in the project specification.

This program utilises the pthread library to demonstrate the efficiency benefits of multi-threading.
This accomplished by implementing a parallelised and standard merge sort algorithm,
which can then be tested with randomly-generated arrays to test the relative performance of each approach.

